<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hant"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="406737204"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="535739353"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="开不了口"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="周杰伦"/><amll:meta key="album" value="一人一首成名曲第四辑(港台版)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:44.973"><div begin="00:27.876" end="04:12.884"><p begin="00:27.876" end="00:32.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:27.876" end="00:29.673">才離開沒</span><span begin="00:29.673" end="00:30.091">多久</span><span begin="00:30.091" end="00:30.523">就</span><span begin="00:30.523" end="00:30.724">開</span><span begin="00:30.724" end="00:31.142">始</span><span begin="00:31.142" end="00:31.589">擔</span><span begin="00:31.589" end="00:32.081">心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才离开没多久就开始担心</span></p><p begin="00:32.091" end="00:34.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:32.091" end="00:32.696">今天的</span><span begin="00:32.696" end="00:33.529">妳過得好</span><span begin="00:33.529" end="00:33.947">不</span><span begin="00:33.947" end="00:34.463">好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天的你过得好不好</span></p><p begin="00:34.773" end="00:40.256" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:34.773" end="00:36.490">整個畫面</span><span begin="00:36.490" end="00:36.775">是</span><span begin="00:36.775" end="00:37.358">妳</span> <span begin="00:37.358" end="00:37.840">想妳</span><span begin="00:37.840" end="00:38.226">想</span><span begin="00:38.226" end="00:38.444">得</span><span begin="00:38.444" end="00:39.091">睡</span><span begin="00:39.091" end="00:39.309">不</span><span begin="00:39.309" end="00:40.256">著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整个画面是你 想你想得睡不着</span></p><p begin="00:41.579" end="00:44.894" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:41.579" end="00:42.157">嘴</span><span begin="00:42.157" end="00:43.408">嘟嘟那</span><span begin="00:43.408" end="00:43.808">可愛</span><span begin="00:43.808" end="00:44.258">的</span><span begin="00:44.258" end="00:44.493">模</span><span begin="00:44.493" end="00:44.894">樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘴嘟嘟那可爱的模样</span></p><p begin="00:44.871" end="00:48.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:44.871" end="00:45.730">還有</span><span begin="00:45.730" end="00:46.586">在妳身上</span><span begin="00:46.586" end="00:47.265">香香的</span><span begin="00:47.265" end="00:47.732">味</span><span begin="00:47.732" end="00:48.168">道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有在你身上香香的味道</span></p><p begin="00:48.471" end="00:54.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:48.471" end="00:48.991">我</span><span begin="00:48.991" end="00:49.824">的快</span><span begin="00:49.824" end="00:50.274">樂</span><span begin="00:50.274" end="00:50.492">是</span><span begin="00:50.492" end="00:50.840">妳</span> <span begin="00:50.840" end="00:52.695">想妳想得</span><span begin="00:52.695" end="00:53.531">都會</span><span begin="00:53.531" end="00:54.196">笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的快乐是你 想你想得都会笑</span></p><p begin="00:54.929" end="01:01.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:54.929" end="00:56.688">沒有妳在</span> <span begin="00:56.688" end="00:58.438">我有多難</span><span begin="00:58.438" end="00:58.766">熬</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:58.576" end="01:01.877"><span begin="00:58.576" end="00:59.271">(沒有妳</span><span begin="00:59.271" end="00:59.703">在</span> <span begin="00:59.703" end="01:00.072">我有</span><span begin="01:00.072" end="01:00.910">多難熬 多</span><span begin="01:00.910" end="01:01.407">煩</span><span begin="01:01.407" end="01:01.877">惱)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你在 我有多难熬 (没有你在 我有多难熬 多烦恼)</span></p><p begin="01:01.844" end="01:08.667" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:01.844" end="01:03.544">沒有妳煩</span> <span begin="01:03.544" end="01:05.277">我有多煩</span><span begin="01:05.277" end="01:06.179">惱</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:05.416" end="01:08.667"><span begin="01:05.416" end="01:06.141">(沒有妳</span><span begin="01:06.141" end="01:06.528">煩</span> <span begin="01:06.528" end="01:06.942">我有</span><span begin="01:06.942" end="01:07.793">多煩惱 多</span><span begin="01:07.793" end="01:08.242">難</span><span begin="01:08.242" end="01:08.667">熬)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你烦 我有多烦恼 (没有你烦 我有多烦恼 多难熬)</span></p><p begin="01:08.621" end="01:14.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:08.621" end="01:10.434">穿過雲層</span> <span begin="01:10.434" end="01:11.302">我試</span><span begin="01:11.302" end="01:11.720">著</span><span begin="01:11.720" end="01:11.920">努</span><span begin="01:11.920" end="01:12.536">力</span><span begin="01:12.536" end="01:12.754">向</span><span begin="01:12.754" end="01:13.389">妳</span><span begin="01:13.389" end="01:13.621">奔</span><span begin="01:13.621" end="01:14.557">跑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过云层 我试着努力向你奔跑</span></p><p begin="01:14.919" end="01:21.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:14.919" end="01:15.336">愛</span><span begin="01:15.336" end="01:15.547">才</span><span begin="01:15.547" end="01:16.421">送到</span> <span begin="01:16.421" end="01:16.839">妳</span><span begin="01:16.839" end="01:17.039">卻</span><span begin="01:17.039" end="01:17.707">已</span><span begin="01:17.707" end="01:17.907">在</span><span begin="01:17.907" end="01:18.558">別</span><span begin="01:18.558" end="01:18.775">人</span><span begin="01:18.775" end="01:19.710">懷</span><span begin="01:19.710" end="01:21.560">抱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱才送到 你却已在别人怀抱</span></p><p begin="01:21.918" end="01:26.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:21.918" end="01:22.438">就是</span><span begin="01:22.438" end="01:24.168">開不了口</span><span begin="01:24.168" end="01:25.454">讓她知</span><span begin="01:25.454" end="01:26.807">道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是开不了口让她知道</span></p><p begin="01:27.537" end="01:33.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:27.537" end="01:28.003">我</span><span begin="01:28.003" end="01:29.293">一定會</span><span begin="01:29.293" end="01:31.012">呵護著妳</span> <span begin="01:31.012" end="01:32.297">也逗妳</span><span begin="01:32.297" end="01:33.682">笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一定会呵护着你 也逗你笑</span></p><p begin="01:34.748" end="01:41.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:34.748" end="01:35.295">妳</span><span begin="01:35.295" end="01:36.163">對我</span><span begin="01:36.163" end="01:37.864">有多重要</span> <span begin="01:37.864" end="01:39.582">我後悔沒</span><span begin="01:39.582" end="01:40.900">讓妳知</span><span begin="01:40.900" end="01:41.367">道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我有多重要 我后悔没让你知道</span></p><p begin="01:41.729" end="01:48.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:41.729" end="01:43.022">安靜地</span><span begin="01:43.022" end="01:44.708">聽妳撒嬌</span> <span begin="01:44.708" end="01:46.458">看妳睡著</span> <span begin="01:46.458" end="01:47.762">一直到</span><span begin="01:47.762" end="01:48.278">老</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">安静地听你撒娇 看你睡着 一直到老</span></p><p begin="01:48.938" end="01:54.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:48.938" end="01:49.863">就是</span><span begin="01:49.863" end="01:51.581">開不了口</span><span begin="01:51.581" end="01:52.916">讓她知</span><span begin="01:52.916" end="01:54.365">道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是开不了口让她知道</span></p><p begin="01:54.869" end="02:01.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:54.869" end="01:56.706">就是那麼</span><span begin="01:56.706" end="01:58.410">簡單幾句</span> <span begin="01:58.410" end="01:59.745">我辦不</span><span begin="01:59.745" end="02:01.228">到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是那么简单几句 我办不到</span></p><p begin="02:02.216" end="02:08.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:02.216" end="02:02.719">整</span><span begin="02:02.719" end="02:03.604">顆心</span><span begin="02:03.604" end="02:05.322">懸在半空</span> <span begin="02:05.322" end="02:07.023">我只能夠</span><span begin="02:07.023" end="02:08.376">遠遠看</span><span begin="02:08.376" end="02:08.825">著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整颗心悬在半空 我只能够远远看着</span></p><p begin="02:09.085" end="02:18.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:09.085" end="02:10.456">這些我</span><span begin="02:10.456" end="02:12.189">都做得到</span> <span begin="02:12.189" end="02:13.910">但那個人</span><span begin="02:13.910" end="02:15.125">已經不</span><span begin="02:15.125" end="02:15.727">是</span><span begin="02:16.173" end="02:18.719">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些我都做得到 但那个人已经不是我</span></p><p begin="02:44.774" end="02:51.671" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:44.774" end="02:46.533">沒有妳在</span> <span begin="02:46.533" end="02:48.283">我有多難</span><span begin="02:48.283" end="02:48.611">熬</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:48.370" end="02:51.671"><span begin="02:48.370" end="02:49.065">(沒有妳</span><span begin="02:49.065" end="02:49.497">在</span> <span begin="02:49.497" end="02:49.866">我有</span><span begin="02:49.866" end="02:50.704">多難熬 多</span><span begin="02:50.704" end="02:51.201">煩</span><span begin="02:51.201" end="02:51.671">惱)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你在 我有多难熬 (没有你在 我有多难熬 多烦恼)</span></p><p begin="02:51.573" end="02:58.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:51.573" end="02:53.273">沒有妳煩</span> <span begin="02:53.273" end="02:55.006">我有多煩</span><span begin="02:55.006" end="02:55.908">惱</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:55.190" end="02:58.441"><span begin="02:55.190" end="02:55.915">(沒有妳</span><span begin="02:55.915" end="02:56.302">煩</span> <span begin="02:56.302" end="02:56.716">我有</span><span begin="02:56.716" end="02:57.567">多煩惱 多</span><span begin="02:57.567" end="02:58.016">難</span><span begin="02:58.016" end="02:58.441">熬)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你烦 我有多烦恼 (没有你烦 我有多烦恼 多难熬)</span></p><p begin="02:58.401" end="03:04.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:58.401" end="03:00.214">穿過雲層</span> <span begin="03:00.214" end="03:01.082">我試</span><span begin="03:01.082" end="03:01.500">著</span><span begin="03:01.500" end="03:01.700">努</span><span begin="03:01.700" end="03:02.316">力</span><span begin="03:02.316" end="03:02.534">向</span><span begin="03:02.534" end="03:03.169">妳</span><span begin="03:03.169" end="03:03.401">奔</span><span begin="03:03.401" end="03:04.337">跑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过云层 我试着努力向你奔跑</span></p><p begin="03:04.781" end="03:11.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="03:04.781" end="03:05.056">愛</span><span begin="03:05.056" end="03:05.323">才</span><span begin="03:05.323" end="03:06.191">送到</span> <span begin="03:06.191" end="03:06.574">妳</span><span begin="03:06.574" end="03:06.774">卻</span><span begin="03:06.774" end="03:07.442">已</span><span begin="03:07.442" end="03:07.674">在</span><span begin="03:07.674" end="03:08.310">別</span><span begin="03:08.310" end="03:08.542">人</span><span begin="03:08.542" end="03:09.526">懷</span><span begin="03:09.526" end="03:11.422">抱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱才送到 你却已在别人怀抱</span></p><p begin="03:11.708" end="03:16.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="03:11.708" end="03:12.228">就是</span><span begin="03:12.228" end="03:13.958">開不了口</span><span begin="03:13.958" end="03:15.244">讓她知</span><span begin="03:15.244" end="03:16.597">道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是开不了口让她知道</span></p><p begin="03:17.326" end="03:23.379" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:17.326" end="03:17.740">我</span><span begin="03:17.740" end="03:19.022">一定會</span><span begin="03:19.022" end="03:20.741">呵護著妳</span> <span begin="03:20.741" end="03:22.027">也逗妳</span><span begin="03:22.027" end="03:23.379">笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一定会呵护着你 也逗你笑</span></p><p begin="03:24.622" end="03:31.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="03:24.622" end="03:25.060">妳</span><span begin="03:25.060" end="03:25.911">對我</span><span begin="03:25.911" end="03:27.614">有多重要</span> <span begin="03:27.614" end="03:29.347">我後悔沒</span><span begin="03:29.347" end="03:30.668">讓妳知</span><span begin="03:30.668" end="03:31.100">道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我有多重要 我后悔没让你知道</span></p><p begin="03:31.397" end="03:37.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="03:31.397" end="03:32.690">安靜地</span><span begin="03:32.690" end="03:34.376">聽妳撒嬌</span> <span begin="03:34.376" end="03:36.126">看妳睡著</span> <span begin="03:36.126" end="03:37.430">一直到</span><span begin="03:37.430" end="03:37.946">老</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">安静地听你撒娇 看你睡着 一直到老</span></p><p begin="03:38.726" end="03:44.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:38.726" end="03:39.581">就是</span><span begin="03:39.581" end="03:41.383">開不了口</span><span begin="03:41.383" end="03:42.661">讓她知</span><span begin="03:42.661" end="03:44.022">道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是开不了口让她知道</span></p><p begin="03:44.629" end="03:50.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:44.629" end="03:46.468">就是那麼</span><span begin="03:46.468" end="03:48.178">簡單幾句</span> <span begin="03:48.178" end="03:48.610">我</span><span begin="03:48.610" end="03:48.828">辦</span><span begin="03:48.828" end="03:49.478">不</span><span begin="03:49.478" end="03:50.887">到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是那么简单几句 我办不到</span></p><p begin="03:51.956" end="03:58.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:51.956" end="03:52.459">整</span><span begin="03:52.459" end="03:53.344">顆心</span><span begin="03:53.344" end="03:55.071">懸在半空</span> <span begin="03:55.071" end="03:55.486">我</span><span begin="03:55.486" end="03:55.704">只</span><span begin="03:55.704" end="03:56.305">能</span><span begin="03:56.305" end="03:56.772">夠</span><span begin="03:56.772" end="03:58.116">遠遠看</span><span begin="03:58.116" end="03:58.565">著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整颗心悬在半空 我只能够远远看着</span></p><p begin="03:58.776" end="04:12.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:58.776" end="04:00.233">這些我</span><span begin="04:00.233" end="04:01.934">都做得到</span> <span begin="04:01.934" end="04:03.620">但那個人</span><span begin="04:03.620" end="04:04.920">已經不</span><span begin="04:04.920" end="04:05.604">是</span><span begin="04:06.541" end="04:12.884">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些我都做得到 但那个人已经不是我</span></p></div></body></tt>